as e escrituradas\nDepósito privativo\nMobiliado, com ar-condicionado e aquecimento a gás\n\nO condomínio:\nPortaria 24 horas, piscina aquecida, piscina externa, academia, salão de festas, espaço gourmet com churrasqueira, salão de jogos, brinquedoteca, playground e quadra esportiva.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6adbb6f158c5fbaece68031a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/cb904bde-3672-4ae3-a87b-07eedb9f32ee.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6adbb6f158c5fbaece68031a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/c1bf466a-9182-4ec5-b81b-43de39a98aaf.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6adbb6f158c5fbaece68031a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/68d0447c-44ad-4f10-bec7-2f1828e65366.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6adbb6f158c5fbaece68031a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/69b9772c-cd0b-4d89-9c9d-2ff29909267b.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6adbb6f158c5fbaece68031a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/19d9910e-b6fd-43c1-8ae2-815141afbc15.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6adbb6f158c5fbaece68031a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b60966eb-57c0-409c-821f-49799a382ac0.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6adbb6f158c5fbaece68031a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/64c29980-235a-4d0b-920b-84b8791a0523.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6adbb6f158c5fbaece68031a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/daf32688-52c4-4f02-995b-2edb03b7162c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6adbb6f158c5fbaece68031a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/3ae926f3-7d0a-426d-8788-749fa39be157.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6adbb6f158c5fbaece68031a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/d5a03da2-f8ab-4af3-8445-7f6798631da9.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6adbb6f158c5fbaece68031a/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5e6dbf07-9532-4afe-a8bb-6102efa738a5.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6adbb6f158c5fb